            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Padrail 1.2.2</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Send feedback right from the menu bar or from Settings, and the website link in Settings is now clickable.</li>
  <li>The edges ignore you while you type, so brushing the trackpad with your palm no longer changes the volume. You can switch it off in Settings.</li>
  <li>After each update a notification tells you what's new, and now and then Padrail can show a short announcement, at most one a day.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
